{"id": "unknown-2026-05-10-013", "date": "2026-05-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 19, "weekday": "Sun"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "E-quipment highlight: Kalmar li-ion Super Heavy electric forklifts", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/05/kalmar_forklift.png?w=1600\" /></div><p>Kalmar rolled out its first-ever li-ion-equipped electric “medium” forklift at last week’s ACT Expo – but Kalmar’s medium isn’t like your medium. Kalmar’s medium forklift trucks can hoist up to 40,000 lbs. And their biggest models can lift more than 4x that. (!)</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"electric-heavy-machinery,forklifts,logistics\" ", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/05/10/e-quipment-highlight-kalmar-li-ion-super-heavy-electric-forklifts/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-05-10-014", "date": "2026-05-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 19, "weekday": "Sun"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["expand"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Frankfurt expands commercial EV fleet with 10 new vocational trucks", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/05/daimler-truck-eeconic.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>The German city is expanding its truck fleet with 10 new, specially upfitted examples of the Mercedes-Benz eEconic heavy-duty EVs, bringing the city’s total count of battery-electric low-floor trucks to 34.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"commercial-evs,electric-semi-truck,mercedes-benz\" data-layer-view", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/05/10/frankfurt-expands-commercial-ev-fleet-with-10-new-vocational-trucks/", "type": "rss"}]}
